      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm slippin', I'm slippin', I'm slippin', I'm slippin', I need a hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Can you squeeze the man? My shit spinnin', spinnin', spinnin', like a ceiling fan",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "No alcohol, no pill in hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "My only vice is them sweets and them wheels I spin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You better calm that down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Fore that nigga pop that round and T.O. will not be found",
          "rhyme": "awnd",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hot, hot glue in my palm like ooh, Spider-Man velcro, nigga, I'm not you, I",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Almost had a mini me, I wasn't ready",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And she wanted it with me, I'm talkin' heavy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Then we had to guarantee, ain't no confetti",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Four million on that car, that's not a Chevy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "See, that's my interest, so as of now, raisin' a child is not on my wish list (Nope)",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Neither is bein' safety net for bitches",
          "rhyme": "atS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'm too selfish, contradiction (Ah)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Maybe I should before I'm too old and washed up like dishes (Washed)",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Never bite tongue 'til a tooth sore",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "If you was gon' apologize, fuck you shoot for? Phew-phew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "When I pop out, they say, \"Ooh, Lord\"",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "No Met Gala, but I'm everybody mood board",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I did a whole collection, collections in Paris",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "They ain't even send me the collection to wear it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I'm so embarrassed, but happy that it happened",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Fuck what you heard, I ain't coon, I ain't tappin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Always some corn from you niggas who ain't poppin', haters",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Always ride another nigga wave, you a sailor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "You could never moonwalk in my Chuck Taylors, brodie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "You niggas is jabronis",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "I'm from the city where they ran up in Sauconys",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Thirty-one zero, shit thirsty, yuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Bitch sued for a mil', tryna work me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Settled at a mil' 'cause that million couldn't hurt me (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "It didn't hurt me (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Nah, it ain't hurt shit (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Sent the motherfuckin' wire, did a backflip (Mm)",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "And if I shoot the club up, it's a Black bitch (Don't say that)",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "On the plane by myself, I ain't pack shit (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Yeah, eating candy yams and some catfish",
          "rhyme": "iS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Hm, yeah, that rich, fuck what you heard, I'm that nigga and I'm that bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
